      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I mwaka me aryo me loc pa kabaka Dario, i nino dwe pyeraryo wiye acel me dwe me abiro, lok pa Rwot obino bot lanebi Aggai ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tit bot Jerubabel wod pa Cealtiel, laloc me Juda, ki bot Yocwa wod pa Yekojadak, ajwaka madit, ki bot jo ducu ma gudoŋ, kun iwacci, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.3.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ejira 3.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Tye ŋat mo ma pud odoŋ i kinwu ma ceŋ oneno ot man ki deyone macon? Kombeddi wuneno tye niŋniŋ? Pe nen ki i waŋwu macalo gin ma konnye pe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi kumeno, in Jerubabel, kombeddi myero ibed ki tekcwiny, man lok pa Rwot kikome; bed ki tekcwiny, in Yocwa, wod pa Yekojadak, ajwaka madit; ki wun jo ducu ma wubedo i lobo-ni, wubed ki tekcwiny, man lok pa Rwot kikome; wuti tic, pien atye kwedwu, man lok pa Rwot me mony kikome, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.29.45+EXO.29.46"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nia 29.45-46",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "macalo ceŋ acikke kwede kwedwu i kare ma wua ki i Ejipt, Cwiny mera bedo i kinwu; pe wulwor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.12.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ibru 12.26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pien Rwot me mony owaco kuman ni, Odoŋ kare man ok keken, abiyeŋo polo ki lobo, nam ki ŋom mutwo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok abiyeŋo rok ducu, wek lonyo me rok ducu obin iye, ka doŋ abipoŋo ot man ki deyo, man Rwot me mony aye owaco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ryal aye mera, jabu bene mera, man lok pa Rwot me many kikome. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deyo me ot man ma lacen bikato mukwoŋo; dok abimiyo kabedo man bedo ki kuc, man Rwot me mony aye owaco.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I mwaka me aryo me loc pa Dario, i nino dwe pyeraryo wiye aŋwen me dwe me aboŋwen, lok pa Rwot obino, kun owok ki i dog lanebi Aggai, ma wacci, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Rwot me mony owaco kuman ni, Peny ajwagi wek gugam peny man, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Ka ce dano mo otiŋo riŋo ma gityero gilonyo odoko maleŋ i dog boŋone, ce dog boŋone-nu ogudo kwon, nyo dek, nyo koŋo vino, nyo moo, nyo kit cam mo keken, ci lonyo cam meno doko leŋ?’ ” Ajwagi gugamo ni, “Pe kumene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.19.11+NUM.19.12+NUM.19.13+NUM.19.14+NUM.19.15+NUM.19.16+NUM.19.17+NUM.19.18+NUM.19.19+NUM.19.20+NUM.19.21+NUM.19.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 19.11-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aggai dok openyo ni, “Ka ce dano mo ma kome ki keni pi gudo kom dano muto, ogudo gin mo i kin jami magi, gin bene doko gin ma keni?” Ajwagi gudok iye ni, “Doko gin ma keni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aggai dok owacci, “Lok pa jo man ki lok pa rok ma tye i nyima tye kit meno, man lok pa Rwot kikome. Man bene mako tic ciŋgi ducu; dok gin ma gityero kunnu gin ma keni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koŋ wutam pi gin ma bitimme cakke tin. Ma noŋo peya gidodo kidi i wi wadi i ot pa Rwot, yam kwowu obedo niŋniŋ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare meno ka nar ma obino i odur kal ka ma myero onoŋ iye adita pyeraryo, noŋo ma romo adita apar keken; ka ŋat ma obino i bur koŋo vino pi twomo opoko pyerabic, noŋo opoko pyeraryo keken. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yam apwodowu, abwaro camwu, amiyo pee ogoyo; ki tic ciŋwu ducu atimo kumeno; ento pe wumedo ki dwogo bota, man lok pa Rwot kikome. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koŋ wutam cakke tin, i nino dwe pyeraryo wiye aŋwen me dwe me aboŋwen cito kwede anyim. Dok wutam, nia i kare ma giketo te guti me ot pa Rwot, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kodi pud tye i dero? Olok, oduro, okwer pomegranat peya ginyak? Cakke tin cito kwede anyim, abimiyowu gum.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lok pa Rwot dok obino bot Aggai tyen me aryo i nino dwe pyeraryo wiye aŋwen ma wacci, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tit bot Jerubabel, laloc me Juda, ni, Acok ka yeŋo polo ki lobo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abituro rok mapol; dok acok tyeko teko me ker pa lurok, abireto gadigadi kacel ki jo ma ŋweco kwedgi, aguragura ki wegigi, ŋat acel acel bipoto piny ma noŋo pala lucwan pa lawote aye oneko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I nino meno, Rwot me mony ma owaco, abitero in Jerubabel, wod pa. Cealtiel, laticca, Rwot ma owaco, abiloki wek ibed macalo agit ciŋ ma gidiyo me lanyut, pien doŋ atyeko yeri, man lok pa Rwot me mony kikome.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
